 history of diabetes and glucose levels on admission</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="bottom"/><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="bottom">DM group</th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="bottom">HG group</th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="bottom"><italic>P</italic> value</th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="bottom">NG group</th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="bottom"><italic>P</italic> value<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="t1fn1">&#x0002a;</xref></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="bottom"><italic>P</italic> value<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="t1fn2">&#x02020;</xref></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top"><italic>n</italic></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="char" char="." valign="top">20</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="char" char="." valign="top">20</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top"/><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="char" char="." valign="top">20</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top"/><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top"/></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Age (years)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">61 &#x000b1; 10</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">60 &#x000b1; 9</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">NS</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">61 &#x000b1; 7</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">NS</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">NS</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Men</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">14 (70)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">16 (80)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top"